WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:30.296
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

3
01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

4
01:35.660 --> 01:38.260
=Episode 26=

5
01:42.680 --> 01:43.120
Your Highness.

6
01:44.350 --> 01:45.120
Where's Yu Cheng'an?

7
01:47.200 --> 01:47.840
He lost.

8
01:57.150 --> 01:57.590
Your Highness.

9
01:59.480 --> 02:00.280
I never thought

10
02:01.310 --> 02:01.950
we'd see

11
02:04.200 --> 02:05.680
the day our revenge finally came.

12
02:17.080 --> 02:17.630
Chunhua.

13
02:20.800 --> 02:21.800
What

14
02:23.000 --> 02:23.960
are your plans now?

15
02:40.800 --> 02:41.630
Last night,

16
02:44.360 --> 02:45.630
Wenji saved me.

17
02:50.240 --> 02:51.430
We hid together.

18
02:53.960 --> 02:55.280
We talked so much nonsense

19
02:57.000 --> 02:58.080
and shared a beautiful dream.

20
03:02.750 --> 03:03.710
But dawn came.

21
03:05.680 --> 03:06.470
Time to wake up.

22
03:10.120 --> 03:10.680
I'll just forget

23
03:13.360 --> 03:14.150
that dream.

24
03:19.430 --> 03:19.960
Your Highness,

25
03:20.870 --> 03:22.120
no matter how much His Majesty dotes on you,

26
03:24.120 --> 03:26.000
he'll never let go of the imperial blood

27
03:28.630 --> 03:30.280
and the mother of the imperial heir.

28
03:40.150 --> 03:40.800
Chunhua.

29
03:43.360 --> 03:44.190
You've been through a lot.

30
03:53.080 --> 03:54.000
Your Highness, have you forgotten?

31
03:55.310 --> 03:56.710
This is the path I chose myself.

32
03:58.630 --> 03:59.430
And since I chose it,

33
04:00.870 --> 04:01.750
I'll see it through.

34
04:16.390 --> 04:16.830
Your Highness.

35
04:17.830 --> 04:19.160
Give the child a childhood name.

36
04:21.510 --> 04:22.510
I always thought

37
04:24.120 --> 04:25.430
that if I ever married,

38
04:26.510 --> 04:27.510
I'd pluck up the courage

39
04:27.950 --> 04:28.920
to ask you to name my child.

40
04:32.390 --> 04:33.430
Let's call him Si'er.

41
04:37.190 --> 04:37.830
Which Si?

42
04:38.510 --> 04:39.310
As in Qing Si, the blue rhino.

43
04:42.040 --> 04:43.390
May this little rhino

44
04:44.720 --> 04:45.390
grow up

45
04:46.390 --> 04:47.680
strong and fearless,

46
04:48.390 --> 04:49.120
able to overcome anything.

47
04:51.360 --> 04:51.920
Si'er.

48
05:11.860 --> 05:14.500
(Tranquility Brings Wisdom)

49
05:46.800 --> 05:48.160
I've been such a failure.

50
05:49.270 --> 05:50.070
For years,

51
05:50.480 --> 05:52.000
that traitor Yu threatened me,

52
05:52.120 --> 05:53.270
and I had to swallow every insult.

53
05:53.920 --> 05:55.430
I've failed my ancestors

54
05:56.480 --> 05:58.040
and my people.

55
06:01.310 --> 06:03.270
I've failed my wife and children too.

56
06:10.000 --> 06:10.630
(Tranquility Brings Wisdom) Get up.

57
06:17.430 --> 06:18.040
And all these years,

58
06:19.240 --> 06:20.510
I've dragged you down with me.

59
06:23.240 --> 06:25.800
Made you suffer every humiliation.

60
06:28.310 --> 06:28.830
Father.

61
06:33.240 --> 06:34.680
Xun, we owe it to you this time.

62
06:35.510 --> 06:36.000
Father.

63
06:36.480 --> 06:37.950
I don't deserve the credit.

64
06:40.800 --> 06:41.750
And Wanyao,

65
06:43.390 --> 06:45.430
you've always been all pouts and tantrums.

66
06:46.120 --> 06:46.630
But

67
06:46.830 --> 06:47.920
when it counted,

68
06:48.630 --> 06:50.070
we couldn't have done it without you.

69
06:56.000 --> 06:56.480
Father.

70
06:58.000 --> 06:59.070
Yu Cheng'an is in prison.

71
06:59.920 --> 07:01.040
What will you do with him?

72
07:08.800 --> 07:10.160
What will I do with him?

73
07:11.160 --> 07:14.240
I'd like to skin him alive and drink his blood!

74
07:27.920 --> 07:29.120
Sentence him to death.

75
07:29.720 --> 07:31.160
Behead him and display his head in public.

76
07:32.160 --> 07:33.510
(Taiji Palace) The eunuch Yu Cheng'an

77
07:33.600 --> 07:34.659
usurped state power,

78
07:34.701 --> 07:35.771
seized military command,

79
07:36.000 --> 07:37.019
persecuted loyal officials,

80
07:37.061 --> 07:38.181
oppressed the people,

81
07:38.430 --> 07:39.389
and imposed excessive taxes.

82
07:39.431 --> 07:40.721
His crimes will stain history for all time.

83
07:41.270 --> 07:42.630
(Duke of Zhao's Residence) He is hereby stripped of his office,

84
07:42.800 --> 07:44.120
arrested, and sent to the Imperial Prison for trial.

85
07:44.390 --> 07:46.000
His 327 accomplices

86
07:46.120 --> 07:47.190
shall be dismissed and exiled,

87
07:47.310 --> 07:48.600
with no pardon even if amnesty is granted.

88
07:49.120 --> 07:50.360
The chief culprit, Yu Cheng'an,

89
07:50.430 --> 07:51.310
has committed unforgivable crimes.

90
07:51.560 --> 07:53.510
Behead him and display his head at Zhuque Gate for three days.

91
07:53.800 --> 07:54.950
Let this decree be proclaimed far and wide,

92
07:55.120 --> 07:56.720
so all may know.

93
08:00.870 --> 08:02.680
You old eunuch! Look who's getting what's coming to him!

94
08:03.630 --> 08:05.390
Buy one! Take one home!

95
08:07.720 --> 08:08.929
Fried fish! Fried fish!

96
08:08.971 --> 08:10.621
Come take a look! Step right up!

97
08:11.120 --> 08:11.870
There's enough for everyone!

98
08:13.270 --> 08:14.240
I want one too!

99
08:14.360 --> 08:14.950
One at a time, everyone.

100
08:16.270 --> 08:17.539
Come on, buy one!

101
08:17.581 --> 08:18.091
Sure.

102
08:18.190 --> 08:18.870
Thank you.

103
08:22.070 --> 08:22.560
Delicious.

104
08:23.950 --> 08:25.680
Strike it three times a day!

105
08:25.870 --> 08:27.369
That evil eunuch never rises again!

106
08:27.411 --> 08:27.971
Come on.

107
08:28.390 --> 08:28.920
Give it a try.

108
08:29.120 --> 08:30.040
Only three wen each.

109
08:30.160 --> 08:31.000
(Zuiyue Tower) Come on, take one.

110
08:32.120 --> 08:33.080
Only three wen.

111
08:33.320 --> 08:33.840
Take one?

112
08:34.080 --> 08:34.510
I'll take one.

113
08:35.240 --> 08:35.819
Sure thing.

114
08:35.861 --> 08:36.171
Thank you.

115
08:36.510 --> 08:37.550
Take care.

116
08:39.790 --> 08:40.579
Come on!

117
08:40.621 --> 08:41.691
Strike it three times a day!

118
08:42.120 --> 08:42.849
That evil eunuch never rises again!

119
08:42.891 --> 08:43.341
Give it a tap?

120
08:45.080 --> 08:45.630
Give it a try.

121
08:46.150 --> 08:48.270
It's such a joyous day. Why the long face?

122
08:48.550 --> 08:49.440
What's with the attitude?

123
08:49.670 --> 08:50.360
Give it a tap.

124
08:52.120 --> 08:52.670
It hurts.

125
08:56.840 --> 08:57.480
Have you heard?

126
08:58.200 --> 09:00.009
That giant black fish in the pond at the Yu residence

127
09:00.051 --> 09:00.741
got hauled out.

128
09:01.790 --> 09:03.270
Took dozens of people pulling a net together

129
09:03.390 --> 09:04.150
(Tea) to haul it out.

130
09:04.840 --> 09:06.030
They butchered it alive right there

131
09:06.270 --> 09:07.150
and shared every last bit.

132
09:07.910 --> 09:08.390
I heard

133
09:08.480 --> 09:10.480
its bones alone

134
09:11.120 --> 09:11.510
were taller than a man.

135
09:12.200 --> 09:13.000
What, you want a bite too?

136
09:13.550 --> 09:14.320
Not really.

137
09:15.670 --> 09:16.750
We made it through!

138
09:17.150 --> 09:18.390
Good fortune follows!

139
09:19.320 --> 09:20.390
I need to find somewhere to pray.

140
09:21.840 --> 09:23.080
Is Yongshou Temple open tonight?

141
09:24.720 --> 09:25.960
Even if it's not,

142
09:26.200 --> 09:27.390
I'm sure

143
09:27.550 --> 09:28.910
you could talk them into opening it.

144
09:32.150 --> 09:32.510
Let's go.

145
09:32.840 --> 09:33.120
Let's go.

146
09:33.750 --> 09:38.958
Roast fish! Roast fish!

147
09:39.000 --> 09:43.318
Roast fish! Roast fish!

148
09:43.360 --> 09:48.678
Roast fish! Roast fish!

149
09:48.720 --> 09:50.960
Roast fish! Roast fish!

150
11:23.390 --> 11:23.790
Cold?

151
11:24.480 --> 11:24.910
A little.

152
11:27.480 --> 11:28.860
(Yan Ruyu)

153
11:30.520 --> 11:31.860
(Mask)

154
11:43.080 --> 11:45.640
(Tea Aromas Abound)

155
11:49.660 --> 11:54.700
(Yan Ruyu)

156
12:04.120 --> 12:08.440
(Tea Aromas Abound, Wenyan Studio)

157
12:35.670 --> 12:36.270
Third-Place Scholar.

158
12:41.440 --> 12:43.360
(Mask) Couldn't afford a second cloak?

159
12:44.120 --> 12:45.080
Need me to lend you some?

160
12:47.480 --> 12:48.360
Congratulations, General Meng.

161
12:49.240 --> 12:50.750
You'll soon be the lord of North Jing, won't you?

162
12:52.480 --> 12:53.360
What are you so happy about?

163
12:54.630 --> 12:56.030
Once I control all of North Jing,

164
12:57.440 --> 12:58.840
it'll be easier for me to ask her old man

165
12:59.510 --> 13:00.200
for her hand.

166
13:03.510 --> 13:04.480
The Eastern Circuit's old forces

167
13:04.870 --> 13:06.390
must be in chaos by now.

168
13:06.720 --> 13:07.720
General Meng,

169
13:07.870 --> 13:09.390
you've got a tough nut to crack this time.

170
13:10.120 --> 13:12.440
With someone beside you dreaming of killing you day and night,

171
13:13.150 --> 13:14.440
life must be rough.

172
13:17.440 --> 13:19.480
General Meng, you never do foolish things.

173
13:21.720 --> 13:23.550
You'd better save your breath and get moving.

174
13:24.510 --> 13:25.270
Any later

175
13:25.440 --> 13:26.320
and you might not get out of here.

176
13:29.670 --> 13:30.960
I said one thing,

177
13:33.030 --> 13:34.649
and you two tag-teamed me

178
13:34.691 --> 13:35.621
with a whole string of comebacks.

179
13:36.270 --> 13:37.390
And you tell me to save my breath?

180
13:42.960 --> 13:43.670
Either way,

181
13:44.870 --> 13:45.790
thank you.

182
13:47.120 --> 13:47.550
What?

183
13:48.790 --> 13:50.030
Not itching to kill me anymore?

184
13:51.630 --> 13:52.670
The past is behind us.

185
13:53.240 --> 13:53.790
We

186
13:54.440 --> 13:55.200
are even now.

187
14:00.030 --> 14:00.390
Indeed.

188
14:04.240 --> 14:05.030
Till we meet again,

189
14:05.550 --> 14:06.080
Mu Wanyao.

190
14:07.080 --> 14:08.510
Better we never meet again,

191
14:09.000 --> 14:09.630
Meng Zaishi.

192
14:26.840 --> 14:30.640
(Mask)

193
15:23.030 --> 15:23.440
Yan Shang.

194
15:24.790 --> 15:25.840
Let me take you somewhere.

195
15:26.670 --> 15:27.000
Alright.

196
15:29.320 --> 15:32.260
(Yan Ruyu)

197
15:45.120 --> 15:45.670
Mother,

198
15:46.030 --> 15:47.270
where are you taking me?

199
15:47.600 --> 15:49.550
How about I take you to see the plum blossoms?

200
15:49.750 --> 15:50.200
Alright.

201
16:03.720 --> 16:04.240
Mother.

202
16:10.630 --> 16:12.120
I've fulfilled

203
16:14.390 --> 16:15.600
what you couldn't finish back then.

204
16:17.390 --> 16:17.960
Tomorrow,

205
16:19.750 --> 16:21.440
Yu Cheng'an will be executed.

206
16:24.360 --> 16:25.150
I

207
16:26.550 --> 16:27.150
have finally

208
16:28.960 --> 16:30.120
tamed the tiger,

209
16:31.200 --> 16:32.320
slain the serpent,

210
16:33.790 --> 16:34.720
and brought peace.

211
16:38.630 --> 16:39.390
You

212
16:40.000 --> 16:40.840
must have seen it.

213
16:42.360 --> 16:43.000
That's why

214
16:44.200 --> 16:44.960
the plum blossoms

215
16:46.600 --> 16:47.790
are blooming so beautifully.

216
16:51.570 --> 16:54.559
♪- Soar with the wind; - Plunge into hellfire as one♪

217
16:54.560 --> 16:56.399
♪Burning bright as a song♪

218
16:56.441 --> 16:59.831
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

219
17:01.960 --> 17:02.720
From Sheng'an

220
17:03.720 --> 17:04.350
to North Jing,

221
17:07.200 --> 17:08.000
from Lingnan

222
17:09.110 --> 17:09.790
to Sheng'an,

223
17:10.370 --> 17:11.980
♪Not a single hour less♪

224
17:12.030 --> 17:12.720
I've traveled this road

225
17:15.750 --> 17:17.200
for so many years.

226
17:20.170 --> 17:22.000
♪We'll be gods above, or wandering souls♪

227
17:22.070 --> 17:22.720
Luckily,

228
17:23.690 --> 17:26.830
♪In heaven or the underworld, you're all I need♪

229
17:26.880 --> 17:27.720
I've met someone

230
17:29.640 --> 17:31.000
willing to walk it with me.

231
17:33.200 --> 17:33.680
Yan Shang.

232
17:34.880 --> 17:35.440
Thank you.

233
17:36.100 --> 17:38.840
♪- May time be free of pain - Boats rock, lights fade, seasons turn♪

234
17:38.890 --> 17:41.010
♪You're the only one I need♪

235
17:43.200 --> 17:43.640
Your Highness,

236
17:45.000 --> 17:45.510
thank you

237
17:46.480 --> 17:47.350
for bringing me to Sheng'an.

238
17:48.820 --> 17:51.940
♪- Be my one and only in this world; - Be my one and only in this life♪

239
17:52.350 --> 17:54.230
♪My last untouched innocence♪

240
17:55.940 --> 17:59.360
♪If only we could return to the village where we first met♪

241
17:59.490 --> 18:02.100
♪Stay by me; help me forget the frozen dream of last night♪

242
18:02.160 --> 18:02.920
Tonight,

243
18:04.160 --> 18:05.960
you should finally be able to sleep well.

244
18:08.240 --> 18:09.610
♪Through dawn and dusk♪

245
18:09.680 --> 18:11.070
My bedtime stories

246
18:12.000 --> 18:13.400
will no longer be needed.

247
18:14.680 --> 18:15.680
I'm afraid

248
18:17.400 --> 18:18.960
I won't get to tell them to you again.

249
18:20.750 --> 18:21.550
Don't you dare.

250
18:22.310 --> 18:22.790
Alright.

251
18:23.350 --> 18:24.510
I'll tell them to you.

252
18:24.640 --> 18:27.760
♪- Till fireworks flood the town - Till the lake is still and clear♪

253
18:28.170 --> 18:30.050
♪The wind blows past us♪

254
18:31.820 --> 18:35.560
♪- If there's still - Some warmth left in this world♪

255
18:36.920 --> 18:39.920
♪You're the only one I need♪

256
18:49.700 --> 18:51.540
(Imperial Prison)

257
19:04.550 --> 19:05.000
Xun.

258
19:05.920 --> 19:06.590
Why are you here?

259
19:07.310 --> 19:08.270
I'm going with you

260
19:08.480 --> 19:09.400
to see Yu Cheng'an executed.

261
19:09.920 --> 19:10.640
What do you want?

262
19:11.160 --> 19:12.960
Back then, Yu Cheng'an forced me to North Jing

263
19:13.160 --> 19:14.030
and humiliated me deeply.

264
19:14.750 --> 19:15.720
He killed Mother

265
19:15.880 --> 19:16.720
and imprisoned Father.

266
19:17.440 --> 19:18.920
I'll send him to his grave myself.

267
19:22.030 --> 19:22.510
Xun.

268
19:23.240 --> 19:24.270
When we formed our alliance,

269
19:25.070 --> 19:26.550
I told you how I truly felt.

270
19:27.350 --> 19:28.830
Everything I've fought so hard for

271
19:29.510 --> 19:30.480
was for this day.

272
19:53.440 --> 19:53.790
Wanyao.

273
20:03.200 --> 20:04.440
The eunuch Yu Cheng'an

274
20:05.000 --> 20:06.030
was a vile wretch,

275
20:06.640 --> 20:07.680
cruel and treacherous,

276
20:08.480 --> 20:09.590
with a heart full of evil...

277
20:10.070 --> 20:10.960
Princess Danyang.

278
20:11.960 --> 20:13.680
It's just the usual list of crimes.

279
20:15.400 --> 20:16.640
Every dynasty has someone who committed them.

280
20:17.440 --> 20:18.400
Winner takes all.

281
20:19.000 --> 20:19.350
Right?

282
20:20.110 --> 20:20.920
No need to read on.

283
20:24.200 --> 20:25.400
What a waste.

284
20:25.790 --> 20:26.750
Wei Qiao's life

285
20:28.920 --> 20:30.160
and Qiu Shuo's life.

286
20:31.350 --> 20:32.350
So many lives.

287
20:33.400 --> 20:35.030
All thrown away for nothing.

288
20:35.790 --> 20:36.830
His Majesty is merciful.

289
20:38.110 --> 20:39.070
Your remaining followers

290
20:39.590 --> 20:40.510
have all been spared execution.

291
20:41.680 --> 20:42.640
They'll only be exiled.

292
20:48.110 --> 20:48.640
Good.

293
20:50.270 --> 20:51.680
His Majesty is indeed merciful.

294
20:53.070 --> 20:54.680
At the temporary imperial palace on the hunting grounds,

295
20:55.030 --> 20:56.440
you knew full well

296
20:56.880 --> 20:58.070
who was inside.

297
20:58.640 --> 20:59.720
Yet you insisted

298
21:00.680 --> 21:02.110
it wasn't His Majesty himself

299
21:02.640 --> 21:05.240
and ordered the Jinwu Guard to charge in.

300
21:06.310 --> 21:07.000
I wonder

301
21:07.590 --> 21:08.160
how His Majesty

302
21:08.920 --> 21:10.440
will view this

303
21:11.070 --> 21:12.110
with his mercy.

304
22:15.400 --> 22:16.070
Yu Cheng'an,

305
22:17.030 --> 22:19.270
what fate has in store for us

306
22:19.960 --> 22:21.160
is none of your concern.

307
22:22.160 --> 22:22.830
Today

308
22:23.720 --> 22:24.680
is the day you die.

309
22:34.830 --> 22:35.830
Thank you, Princess Danyang.

310
22:57.510 --> 22:59.400
This wine is called Qianji.

311
23:01.350 --> 23:02.110
Once swallowed,

312
23:02.440 --> 23:03.400
it twists your insides

313
23:03.960 --> 23:04.720
in agony.

314
23:05.830 --> 23:08.400
The Investigation Office used it often back in the day.

315
23:09.000 --> 23:10.030
After drinking it,

316
23:11.030 --> 23:12.550
you'll scream nonstop.

317
23:13.000 --> 23:14.440
You'll thrash for about five hours

318
23:14.920 --> 23:16.960
before your insides finally give out.

319
23:17.880 --> 23:19.160
Countless souls died unjustly at Yintaimen.

320
23:20.350 --> 23:21.440
You brought it on yourself.

321
23:21.680 --> 23:22.160
Yes.

322
23:23.680 --> 23:24.640
Indeed.

323
23:25.510 --> 23:26.440
I deserve it.

324
23:27.440 --> 23:28.790
I'm just thinking...

325
23:30.790 --> 23:32.640
Your father

326
23:33.440 --> 23:34.590
still doesn't have

327
23:37.830 --> 23:40.070
the courage to face me, even now.

328
23:41.590 --> 23:44.310
He won't even grant me the mercy of a quick death

329
23:45.000 --> 23:46.550
with a cup of poisoned wine.

330
23:47.000 --> 23:48.750
You'd better drink it.

331
23:49.960 --> 23:51.240
Or I'll have someone make you.

332
24:03.200 --> 24:04.400
Who would've thought?

333
24:05.790 --> 24:06.680
For all its poison,

334
24:08.440 --> 24:09.070
Qianji wine

335
24:10.440 --> 24:12.270
has quite a fine taste.

336
24:22.240 --> 24:23.480
Now I've swallowed this.

337
24:25.480 --> 24:27.790
My death's a sure thing.

338
24:29.400 --> 24:31.070
But you who still live

339
24:32.070 --> 24:33.960
have yet to see how things will end for you.

340
24:34.590 --> 24:35.480
I imagine

341
24:36.030 --> 24:37.400
your father

342
24:40.110 --> 24:42.440
hasn't changed his ways.

343
24:44.270 --> 24:46.720
The way he treated his first wife back then...

344
24:47.270 --> 24:47.920
I doubt

345
24:49.070 --> 24:50.459
he'll treat his children

346
24:50.501 --> 24:52.941
any differently.

347
24:53.720 --> 24:54.510
What do you mean?

348
24:56.640 --> 24:57.350
Almost forgot.

349
24:58.960 --> 25:01.000
None of you know how the Empress

350
25:01.350 --> 25:02.480
really died.

351
25:06.070 --> 25:07.249
Back then, you drove

352
25:07.291 --> 25:08.851
the Empress to her death and coerced my father.

353
25:09.750 --> 25:11.750
Then you claimed she'd taken her own life.

354
25:12.110 --> 25:12.790
Your Royal Highness,

355
25:13.270 --> 25:15.160
I've killed countless people in my life.

356
25:15.590 --> 25:16.680
Why would I

357
25:17.000 --> 25:18.920
dodge blame for this one?

358
25:19.680 --> 25:20.000
Yes.

359
25:21.000 --> 25:22.110
She

360
25:22.720 --> 25:24.270
did take her own life.

361
25:25.070 --> 25:26.550
But I wasn't the one who drove her to it.

362
25:27.110 --> 25:28.000
It was your father.

363
25:29.200 --> 25:30.310
Nonsense!

364
25:31.720 --> 25:32.880
I'm a dying man.

365
25:33.550 --> 25:35.350
You two are still here

366
25:35.510 --> 25:38.160
because you want to hear my final ramblings, aren't you?

367
25:47.240 --> 25:47.680
Go on.

368
25:51.510 --> 25:52.110
Back then,

369
25:52.680 --> 25:54.920
after I put down the Rebellion of the Seven Military Governors,

370
25:55.550 --> 25:57.110
my standing at court grew higher and higher.

371
25:57.640 --> 25:59.400
But I made one fatal mistake.

372
26:00.200 --> 26:01.160
My merit overawed the sovereign.

373
26:02.270 --> 26:05.240
So the Empress and the Emperor plotted together

374
26:05.680 --> 26:06.550
to lure me into a trap

375
26:07.160 --> 26:08.350
and have me killed.

376
26:19.790 --> 26:20.720
But fate

377
26:21.160 --> 26:22.550
had other plans for me.

378
26:24.160 --> 26:26.000
Your father fell to his knees,

379
26:26.830 --> 26:28.899
clutched my boots, and begged me to spare his life.

380
26:28.941 --> 26:31.661
(Ying'er!)

381
26:32.790 --> 26:33.680
To save himself,

382
26:34.400 --> 26:35.569
he blamed everything

383
26:35.611 --> 26:37.771
on the Empress.

384
26:39.350 --> 26:40.750
The hardships

385
26:41.070 --> 26:42.160
of the Rebellion

386
26:42.590 --> 26:44.030
had never broken her.

387
26:45.400 --> 26:47.000
But her own husband,

388
26:48.110 --> 26:49.480
the father of her child,

389
26:50.680 --> 26:51.640
her lord,

390
26:52.310 --> 26:54.310
betrayed her to the enemy.

391
26:55.640 --> 26:56.350
That was what

392
26:57.590 --> 26:58.550
broke her

393
26:59.750 --> 27:01.480
and drove her to take her own life.

394
27:11.200 --> 27:11.680
One more thing.

395
27:13.270 --> 27:14.030
Princess Danyang,

396
27:15.350 --> 27:16.720
on the night you were born,

397
27:17.030 --> 27:18.590
I was in the Liangyi Hall.

398
27:19.640 --> 27:21.550
I saw your father

399
27:22.270 --> 27:23.680
make up that prophecy with my own eyes.

400
27:25.440 --> 27:26.160
At the time,

401
27:27.680 --> 27:29.270
the regional governors were restless.

402
27:30.270 --> 27:31.200
And Huai

403
27:31.960 --> 27:34.590
had suffered years of floods and droughts.

404
27:35.400 --> 27:36.110
As if that weren't enough,

405
27:36.960 --> 27:38.830
a meteor fell from the sky,

406
27:40.030 --> 27:41.750
crashed into the roof of the Imperial Ancestral Temple,

407
27:42.160 --> 27:43.200
and set it ablaze.

408
27:44.270 --> 27:47.310
Your father nearly issued an Edict of Introspection.

409
27:49.790 --> 27:50.750
(I have failed in virtue,) And that very night,

410
27:51.790 --> 27:53.000
(and Heaven has sent these signs. I shall reflect deeply on my faults.) you were born.

411
27:54.400 --> 27:55.160
That gave him

412
27:55.750 --> 27:58.400
an explanation for everything.

413
27:59.070 --> 28:00.920
(Lizheng Hall) Your father ordered the court historians

414
28:01.350 --> 28:03.510
to record that the falling meteor was no disaster,

415
28:03.830 --> 28:04.920
but an auspicious sign.

416
28:05.880 --> 28:06.510
An auspicious sign.

417
28:07.830 --> 28:08.550
Clever, wasn't he?

418
28:09.590 --> 28:11.440
A princess born under an auspicious sign

419
28:11.880 --> 28:12.400
could

420
28:12.640 --> 28:14.790
help him out of his immediate crisis.

421
28:15.920 --> 28:17.200
And once she grew up,

422
28:17.750 --> 28:19.550
she'd be useful in other ways.

423
28:20.750 --> 28:21.270
(North Jing)

424
28:21.750 --> 28:22.750
(has a powerful army.)

425
28:23.350 --> 28:24.400
(Your Majesty, surely you don't want)

426
28:25.110 --> 28:28.270
(the Rebellion of the Seven Military Governors to happen again?)

427
28:29.310 --> 28:30.400
(The daughter of the Yaoguang Star)

428
28:30.920 --> 28:32.270
(shall bring prosperity to the imperial house.)

429
28:32.830 --> 28:33.750
(Everyone knows)

430
28:34.160 --> 28:35.350
(this prophecy.)

431
28:36.680 --> 28:37.640
(Princess Danyang)

432
28:38.160 --> 28:41.270
(is the ideal match for Meng Baiyu.)

433
28:44.480 --> 28:47.240
(Imperial Decree for Princess Danyang) (Princess Danyang shall bring prosperity.)

434
28:47.790 --> 28:49.680
(The princess bears an auspicious sign.)

435
28:49.920 --> 28:52.960
(She is the ideal match for Meng Baiyu.)

436
28:54.750 --> 28:55.640
What a shame.

437
28:57.110 --> 28:58.160
The Mus are lucky to have you,

438
28:59.790 --> 29:01.880
but fate made you a girl.

439
29:04.830 --> 29:05.240
Alright.

440
29:06.550 --> 29:07.899
Thank you, Your Royal Highness, Your Highness,

441
29:07.941 --> 29:09.421
for seeing me off on my final journey.

442
29:10.350 --> 29:11.030
I've said all I have to say.

443
29:11.680 --> 29:12.000
See yourselves out.

444
29:21.920 --> 29:22.720
Your Royal Highness, Your Highness,

445
29:25.240 --> 29:26.070
if you would be so kind,

446
29:27.270 --> 29:28.440
could you send someone

447
29:29.550 --> 29:31.350
to the Grand Princess Luling's Residence

448
29:32.310 --> 29:33.200
and ask

449
29:34.750 --> 29:36.480
if she'd come to see me one last time?

450
29:44.760 --> 29:47.700
(Imperial Prison)

451
29:54.510 --> 29:54.960
Wanyao,

452
29:56.000 --> 29:57.350
don't believe everything that traitor Yu said.

453
29:58.480 --> 29:59.960
He's cunning and vicious.

454
30:00.550 --> 30:01.400
He may well be trying to

455
30:01.920 --> 30:03.350
drive a wedge between family before he dies.

456
30:07.110 --> 30:07.590
And

457
30:08.640 --> 30:09.510
you're smart.

458
30:10.550 --> 30:11.400
We must both keep

459
30:12.160 --> 30:13.070
what happened today

460
30:14.160 --> 30:15.160
to ourselves.

461
30:15.640 --> 30:16.270
Of course.

462
30:16.640 --> 30:17.440
Don't worry, Xun.

463
30:22.920 --> 30:24.280
(Imperial Prison)

464
30:41.750 --> 30:42.399
That villain

465
30:42.441 --> 30:43.881
is still trying to drive a wedge between you all,

466
30:43.960 --> 30:44.720
just to make you uncomfortable.

467
30:45.270 --> 30:45.640
Your Royal Highness,

468
30:46.350 --> 30:47.030
no matter what,

469
30:47.440 --> 30:48.720
you're His Majesty's son.

470
30:49.200 --> 30:50.200
And you saved his life.

471
30:51.110 --> 30:52.790
I'm sure His Majesty won't hold this against you.

472
30:58.000 --> 30:58.920
Actually, besides us and Wanyao,

473
30:59.790 --> 31:01.240
Lu Yan, the Jinwu Guard,

474
31:02.350 --> 31:03.680
Wei Shu, and a young eunuch

475
31:04.160 --> 31:06.000
all helped secure the victory this time.

476
31:06.920 --> 31:07.830
Yet none of them

477
31:08.400 --> 31:09.440
have been summoned by His Majesty.

478
31:09.790 --> 31:10.480
That's true.

479
31:10.920 --> 31:12.510
I wonder how His Majesty will reward them.

480
31:13.440 --> 31:13.830
Yang Si,

481
31:14.680 --> 31:15.510
keep an eye on things.

482
31:16.030 --> 31:17.480
Let me know at once if anything happens.

483
31:18.070 --> 31:18.830
I want to know

484
31:20.000 --> 31:21.160
what becomes of them.

485
31:41.270 --> 31:41.720
Your Highness.

486
31:44.270 --> 31:44.750
What is it?

487
31:47.880 --> 31:49.200
Is it His Majesty's health?

488
31:52.160 --> 31:52.750
I'm fine.

489
31:54.880 --> 31:56.720
I heard Yu Cheng'an was given poisoned wine.

490
31:57.640 --> 31:59.270
You've finally avenged your country and your family.

491
32:00.350 --> 32:00.750
Wanyao.

492
32:02.270 --> 32:02.790
Congratulations.

493
32:21.590 --> 32:23.350
Can you tell me what happened?

494
32:24.440 --> 32:25.350
I don't want to talk about it.

495
32:30.310 --> 32:30.680
Alright.

496
32:31.920 --> 32:33.790
If you ever change your mind,

497
32:34.720 --> 32:35.880
I'll be here to listen.

498
32:38.200 --> 32:38.790
Yan Shang.

499
32:41.720 --> 32:42.880
I'll protect you.

500
32:45.880 --> 32:46.880
No matter when,

501
32:48.920 --> 32:50.400
no matter what happens,

502
32:52.510 --> 32:53.920
I'll protect you.

503
33:39.510 --> 33:40.110
Yu Cheng'an.

504
33:41.590 --> 33:42.200
Yu Cheng'an!

505
33:45.350 --> 33:45.790
Your Highness!

506
33:51.070 --> 33:51.680
Get up.

507
33:52.960 --> 33:53.920
Get up!

508
33:54.830 --> 33:56.240
How dare you scare me like that!

509
34:05.550 --> 34:06.240
Your Highness, thank...

510
34:07.270 --> 34:09.110
Thank you for coming to see me.

511
34:11.360 --> 34:13.070
Weren't you always so formidable?

512
34:14.590 --> 34:16.110
You stupid fool.

513
34:17.630 --> 34:19.070
How am I supposed to go on?

514
34:20.480 --> 34:21.880
They won't let me off.

515
34:23.150 --> 34:23.550
Your Highness.

516
34:24.000 --> 34:24.440
Don't be afraid.

517
34:25.070 --> 34:25.550
Don't be afraid.

518
34:26.630 --> 34:27.960
You fool.

519
34:30.920 --> 34:32.920
You absolute fool!

520
34:36.230 --> 34:36.550
Yes.

521
34:37.280 --> 34:37.710
Yes.

522
34:38.480 --> 34:38.960
Your Highness.

523
34:41.110 --> 34:42.000
I asked you here

524
34:43.480 --> 34:44.440
because there's something

525
34:45.230 --> 34:45.840
I must tell you.

526
34:46.510 --> 34:47.150
Go on.

527
34:51.320 --> 34:51.670
Your Highness.

528
34:55.800 --> 34:56.510
No one

529
34:57.280 --> 34:58.510
must ever find out about this child.

530
34:59.670 --> 35:00.800
I was drunk that night.

531
35:01.400 --> 35:03.960
I really can't remember who was attending to me.

532
35:05.510 --> 35:05.960
Yu Cheng'an.

533
35:07.480 --> 35:08.840
Get rid of him.

534
35:10.800 --> 35:11.670
I can't let him live.

535
35:21.400 --> 35:22.070
I

536
35:23.630 --> 35:25.590
didn't do as you ordered.

537
35:28.710 --> 35:30.280
I raised that child

538
35:31.000 --> 35:32.400
myself.

539
35:33.110 --> 35:34.320
He's my adopted son,

540
35:36.030 --> 35:36.590
Xianyao.

541
35:39.360 --> 35:39.960
I know.

542
35:42.230 --> 35:43.480
I've seen him many times

543
35:45.190 --> 35:46.440
at your residence.

544
35:49.000 --> 35:50.190
Greetings, Grand Princess.

545
35:54.800 --> 35:55.630
You've grown taller.

546
36:04.320 --> 36:04.670
Alright.

547
36:05.760 --> 36:06.190
You've met him.

548
36:10.590 --> 36:11.400
I'm sorry.

549
36:12.550 --> 36:13.190
I'm really sorry.

550
36:14.710 --> 36:17.880
I couldn't protect that child to the end.

551
36:19.920 --> 36:20.710
Yu Cheng'an.

552
36:22.710 --> 36:24.320
I didn't come to this wretched place

553
36:25.070 --> 36:26.880
to hear you say all that!

554
36:29.480 --> 36:30.320
I don't care

555
36:30.710 --> 36:31.510
where

556
36:32.190 --> 36:33.000
that child is

557
36:34.070 --> 36:35.280
or who he is.

558
36:40.070 --> 36:40.480
Alright.

559
36:41.230 --> 36:41.630
Alright.

560
36:53.510 --> 36:54.480
If you hadn't entered

561
36:56.840 --> 36:58.590
my residence

562
37:01.710 --> 37:02.920
and met me,

563
37:05.630 --> 37:06.190
you'd

564
37:08.510 --> 37:10.630
be alive and well today.

565
37:13.760 --> 37:14.630
If

566
37:15.710 --> 37:17.070
I'd never met you,

567
37:18.880 --> 37:20.190
how dull my life

568
37:20.670 --> 37:22.150
would've been.

569
37:34.630 --> 37:35.320
Luling.

570
37:38.800 --> 37:39.320
I

571
37:42.760 --> 37:43.670
did all I could.

572
37:46.920 --> 37:48.070
I, Yu Cheng'an...

573
37:51.510 --> 37:52.670
I, Yu Cheng'an,

574
37:56.320 --> 37:57.000
have no regrets

575
37:58.590 --> 37:59.360
in this life!

576
38:16.760 --> 38:17.630
When I was young,

577
38:19.760 --> 38:21.710
I loved this cherry custard.

578
38:25.960 --> 38:26.510
Here,

579
38:27.670 --> 38:28.800
have another taste.

580
38:49.710 --> 38:50.230
(Stable boy,)

581
38:51.840 --> 38:53.070
(you've never tasted this before, have you?)

582
39:05.800 --> 39:08.320
Your Highness...

583
39:09.000 --> 39:09.800
Go on.

584
39:12.800 --> 39:13.760
Say it!

585
39:18.880 --> 39:21.510
Say it!

586
39:28.710 --> 39:30.230
Go on.

587
39:32.960 --> 39:34.360
Say it!

588
39:49.360 --> 39:50.360
What are you doing here?

589
39:52.000 --> 39:52.590
Qiao.

590
39:53.630 --> 39:54.880
You're the top scholar.

591
39:55.590 --> 39:57.190
You have a reputation to protect.

592
40:24.710 --> 40:26.190
I thought it was wine.

593
40:28.440 --> 40:29.840
You're still injured.

594
40:30.550 --> 40:31.880
I'm dying anyway.

595
40:32.590 --> 40:34.280
What does it matter

596
40:35.630 --> 40:36.360
if my wounds heal?

597
40:38.670 --> 40:39.150
Qiao.

598
40:40.030 --> 40:41.190
His Majesty has issued his decree.

599
40:41.630 --> 40:42.960
Only Yu Cheng'an is sentenced to death.

600
40:43.550 --> 40:44.440
The rest

601
40:45.000 --> 40:45.480
are to be exiled.

602
41:07.590 --> 41:08.480
Shu.

603
41:09.630 --> 41:11.190
Do you remember

604
41:12.400 --> 41:13.360
when we were kids

605
41:14.320 --> 41:16.190
and our teacher made us kneel as punishment?

606
41:17.110 --> 41:17.550
I do.

607
41:18.360 --> 41:18.960
It was because

608
41:19.280 --> 41:20.710
I let the teacher's pet bird go.

609
41:22.190 --> 41:22.710
Yeah.

610
41:24.030 --> 41:25.030
I saw it.

611
41:25.550 --> 41:26.630
Instead of stopping you,

612
41:27.110 --> 41:28.320
I kept watch for you.

613
41:29.230 --> 41:30.710
The teacher was furious.

614
41:35.480 --> 41:36.510
You

615
41:37.070 --> 41:38.070
didn't have to suffer punishment.

616
41:39.000 --> 41:40.030
I was the one who let the bird go.

617
41:41.360 --> 41:42.110
But

618
41:43.030 --> 41:45.110
if I hadn't joined in,

619
41:46.110 --> 41:48.550
you'd have faced much worse than kneeling.

620
41:49.840 --> 41:51.670
If you'd been expelled,

621
41:52.150 --> 41:52.960
who

622
41:53.840 --> 41:55.320
would've studied with me?

623
41:56.630 --> 41:57.150
Qiao.

624
41:58.360 --> 41:58.960
Thank you.

625
42:07.400 --> 42:08.440
Even a bird

626
42:09.320 --> 42:10.960
may win mercy

627
42:11.880 --> 42:13.280
and be set free.

628
42:14.880 --> 42:16.510
Yet in this vast world,

629
42:16.710 --> 42:17.760
people can spend

630
42:18.550 --> 42:20.110
their whole lives in chains,

631
42:21.920 --> 42:23.190
never finding freedom.

632
42:27.440 --> 42:28.400
Shu.

633
42:29.760 --> 42:31.000
You're freer than I am.

634
42:31.670 --> 42:33.280
If you ever get the chance,

635
42:37.360 --> 42:40.710
go see the world's fair sights for me.

636
42:41.480 --> 42:42.710
When your sentence is over,

637
42:43.360 --> 42:44.320
we'll go see them together.

638
42:51.000 --> 42:51.590
Time's up.

639
42:54.400 --> 42:55.070
You should go.

640
42:56.440 --> 42:57.360
No need to come again.

641
43:03.840 --> 43:04.320
Qiao.

642
43:05.510 --> 43:06.320
Take care of your wounds.

643
43:07.510 --> 43:08.510
I'll come see you again.

644
43:12.070 --> 43:12.440
Alright.

645
43:28.070 --> 43:29.000
Good riddance!

646
43:30.320 --> 43:31.230
Serves him right.

647
43:32.670 --> 43:33.510
Grand Princess Luling?

648
43:34.190 --> 43:35.320
What is she doing here?

649
43:46.110 --> 43:46.920
Watch your words.

650
43:51.400 --> 43:52.360
It really is the Grand Princess.

651
43:52.510 --> 43:53.230
Keep your voice down.

652
44:38.360 --> 44:39.150
(Stable boy.)

653
44:40.760 --> 44:41.510
(Let's go home.)

654
44:43.500 --> 44:47.940
(Next Episode Preview)

655
44:48.760 --> 44:50.030
The Princess issued a false decree.

656
44:50.630 --> 44:52.280
Was that her own idea,

657
44:53.000 --> 44:55.320
or did you put her up to it?

658
44:56.920 --> 44:57.630
Bring it here.

659
45:05.040 --> 45:08.333
♪Be the ferry where you wait for the sun♪

660
45:11.018 --> 45:15.934
♪Be the blue silk that catches your tears♪

661
45:18.128 --> 45:23.973
♪Be the sleeve we held, worn by dust and years♪

662
45:24.473 --> 45:29.699
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

663
45:32.468 --> 45:37.259
♪Let me be a captive beast bound by the same lock as you♪

664
45:38.095 --> 45:44.174
♪- Through trails of mud and blood; - let grief drown in your eyes♪

665
45:45.975 --> 45:49.125
♪Soar with the wind; plunge into hellfire as one♪

666
45:49.125 --> 45:50.773
♪Burning bright as a song♪

667
45:50.825 --> 45:54.549
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

668
45:54.927 --> 45:59.593
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

669
46:00.212 --> 46:04.253
♪If we say forever, then forever it shall be♪

670
46:04.744 --> 46:06.859
♪Not a single hour less♪

671
46:06.899 --> 46:13.845
♪However deep the snow, I'll wait if you're there♪

672
46:14.608 --> 46:18.061
♪We'll be gods above, or wandering souls♪

673
46:18.241 --> 46:21.386
♪In heaven or the underworld, you're all I need♪

674
46:21.825 --> 46:28.462
